## Slide 4

Content Parts | Data Table Range and Filters

By default the Data Table Part looks for the standard SD, ED, SDT and EDT Keys to determine Date Range filter Values
Range Key Prefix allows for customizing the expected Values Dictionary Keys
Range Key Prefix = Custom.
Keys expected = Custom.ED, Custom.SD, Custom.SDT, Custom.EDT
Filters allow constant values or Values Dictionary Keys to be mapped to Properties

Filters
Data Providers
Data Consumers

## Slide 5

Content Parts | Data Table Columns and Sorting

The Columns that are returned by the Data Table Part can be selected from a pre-configured list of Options
Selecting only the needed fields can improve the Query Performance
The resultant DataTable can be sorted by one ore more configurable Columns (Ascending or Descending)

